    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tscerpi_rate7"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the AGIRC-ARRCO employer complementary old-age pension contribution rate of 12.95%, applied to Income Groups B and C (income above the PSS ceiling) for white-collar (cadre) employees. It is used in tscer_fr's BenCalc function (Comp_perTU parameter, 'Old-age insurance contributions-main'); the Country Report notes that for Income Group C the split between employer and employee shares is assumed to follow the same pattern as Group B, since this is in practice subject to firm-level negotiation."
